        246.438720703125,
        472.1962890625
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.44720458984375,
        350.33856201171875,
        495.59222412109375
      ],
      "text": "This section deals with the following additional question:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.4347839355469,
        465.8425598144531,
        521.5227661132812
      ],
      "text": "What are the comparative costs, affordability and cost–effectiveness of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.8348388671875,
        247.0645294189453,
        535.9227905273438
      ],
      "text": "implementation of LC-mNAATs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.5897216796875,
        527.1242065429688,
        559.7347412109375
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review commissioned by WHO aimed to identify, evaluate and summarize",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.0897216796875,
        527.2142944335938,
        575.2347412109375
      ],
      "text": "the findings of available economic evidence on LC-mNAATs, among other technologies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.5897216796875,
        524.3872680664062,
        590.7347412109375
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review provided an in-depth analysis of the financial implications and cost–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.0897216796875,
        526.8944702148438,
        606.2347412109375
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness of implementing TB LAMP in diverse settings. Through a range of economic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.5897216796875,
        526.7503051757812,
        621.7347412109375
      ],
      "text": "analyses, including cost–utility, cost–benefit and cost–affordability assessments, this study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.0897216796875,
        467.0353088378906,
        637.2347412109375
      ],
      "text": "contributes valuable insights into the potential role of TB LAMP in TB diagnostics.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.0936889648438,
        527.1858520507812,
        661.2387084960938
      ],
      "text": "After removing 638 duplicate studies from those identified in the original search, 1990 unique",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990095138549805,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.5936889648438,
        526.7496337890625,
        676.7387084960938
      ],
      "text": "studies remained. Of these, six studies were included in the final systematic review. Studies that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970259666442871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.0936889648438,
        526.9479370117188,
        692.2387084960938
      ],
      "text": "did not involve people with TB, used TB LAMP as a diagnostic intervention or did not contain",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.5936889648438,
        526.9617309570312,
        707.7387084960938
      ],
      "text": "cost data were excluded. Of the six included studies, one performed a cost–utility analysis,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        710.0936889648438,
        526.9644775390625,
        723.2387084960938
      ],
      "text": "and two performed a cost–affordability analysis. The three other studies estimated the cost",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.5936889648438,
        129.7266082763672,
        738.7387084960938
      ],
      "text": "of TB LAMP.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "44 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
